# Include Directory

This directory contains public C/C++ header files (`.h`) for the Shahoshi Wearable application:
- `config.h` - Auto-generated environment macros from `.env`
- `logger.h` - LittleFS date-formatted log system
- `buzzer.h` - Audio siren and beep driver
- `alert_email.h` - Brevo HTTPS REST API client
- `gps_handler.h` - TinyGPS++ NMEA parser & Google Maps URL formatter
- `heuristics.h` - Emergency rule evaluation engine

Refer to the main [README.md](file:///f:/Shahoshi_Wearable/Shahoshi_Wearable/README.md) in the project root for full setup and build instructions.
